Worker: 
    a) Kubelet ==> Scheduling pods on worker on request from "Schedular"
    b) Kube Proxy ==> Internal network
    c) Container Runtime Interface ==> To run container we require CRI, we currenly use docker

Master Node: 
    a) Api Server ==> Enter point of request to cluster
    b) Schedular ==> Where to schedule pod based on resources available
    c) Controller Manager ==> Detect state changes in cluster
    d) ectd ==> Store cluster data in Key Value format


Kubernetes services: 
ClusterIP, NodePort, LoadBalancer, and Ingress


Type of object/kind in Kubernetes:
1) Pod
2) Deployment
3) ReplicaSets
4) StatefulSet
5) DeamonSets
6) PersistentVolume
7) Service
8) Namespaces
9-10) ConfigMaps & Secrets
11) Job
12) Cronjob


